  "instance_name": "self_deprecating_humor",
  "label": "self_deprecating_humor",
  "description": "Self-deprecating humor is a form of humor in which the subject makes fun of themselves or their own shortcomings. The meme uses self-deprecating humor to suggest that the act of not stealing for a week is so rare or virtuous that it deserves angelic status, which is an exaggerated and humorous way to acknowledge the difficulty of resisting temptation. This requires understanding the concept of self-deprecating humor as a comedic technique.",
